{"name": "Cozy Builder", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>Cozy Builder</strong>, a relaxing sandbox builder set among rolling hills and sun-dappled vineyards. Design your dream ch\u00e2teau from modular architectural pieces, decorate every detail inside and out, and bring the valley back to life as you harvest grapes and craft artisanal wine blends in your own countryside retreat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/f51cc08aabaac7fc2a57939eff0d6170.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After enduring an earthquake, the once-bustling Vineyard Valley now rests in quiet disrepair. Restore its beauty, rebuild its homes, and bring warmth and life back to the countryside. Each home you bring back to life helps the valley bloom again, turning forgotten places into reflections of peace and care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/7e441b9ded0eea2285f470acba0cdd25.poster.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/7e441b9ded0eea2285f470acba0cdd25.webm?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/7e441b9ded0eea2285f470acba0cdd25.mp4?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/e9387ad598be50f486d1bd02f1718020.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build from the ground up using intricate, customizable pieces. Create ivy-covered walls, elegant arches, and gabled rooftops that reflect your personal style. Whether you dream of a rustic cottage or a grand estate, every home in <strong>Cozy Builder</strong> tells its own story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/8b983bd99d6c23ae8a0e6f0a2ca5ea4c.poster.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/8b983bd99d6c23ae8a0e6f0a2ca5ea4c.webm?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/8b983bd99d6c23ae8a0e6f0a2ca5ea4c.mp4?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/57d3a2ddd88459b353fcc15c5503d933.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Furnish interiors with art, cozy furniture, and handcrafted details that make your spaces feel alive. Step outside to design gardens, terraces, and greenhouses bursting with flowers and greenery. Every decoration adds warmth and charm to your vineyard retreat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/e2ec4d4b4abe8f8c23c49086ce0d9bfe.poster.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/e2ec4d4b4abe8f8c23c49086ce0d9bfe.webm?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/e2ec4d4b4abe8f8c23c49086ce0d9bfe.mp4?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/4e840acc953dc1fa8de1595a5c4a4c48.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With abundant sunshine across the valley, no home is complete without a greenhouse. Create elegant glass structures filled with light, color, and life, seamlessly connected to your home interiors. Collect rare plants, nurture flowers, and design lush indoor gardens that blur the line between inside and out. Your greenhouse is both a sanctuary and a living work of art.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/ced42b7a99d5a89162241511d13781c2.poster.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/ced42b7a99d5a89162241511d13781c2.webm?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/ced42b7a99d5a89162241511d13781c2.mp4?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/f24839f06d4cb00b00131e37664a098d.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bask in the sunlight as you walk through rolling vineyards surrounded by gentle hills and golden light. Harvest ripe grapes, olives, and other produce nurtured by the valley\u2019s rich soil. Ferment, blend, and bottle your own artisanal wines!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/d36744cb6ae33a797ba8554caa4bd95f.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The valley is abundant with life. Gather heirloom produce, forage for herbs and wildflowers, and craft artisanal blends, preserves, and rustic goods to share with the townsfolk or sell to fund your next creation. Each harvest connects you more deeply to the valley you\u2019ve helped revive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/7f0f8d038329cb43e9f009ace823a0c2.poster.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/7f0f8d038329cb43e9f009ace823a0c2.webm?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/7f0f8d038329cb43e9f009ace823a0c2.mp4?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"80\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/5761783613dce61f214dd4554f39cdf4.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step inside your ch\u00e2teau in immersive 3D and enjoy the peaceful life you\u2019ve built. Explore scenic hills, unwind under the warm vineyard sun, and find joy in every detail of your creation. <strong>Cozy Builder</strong> is a relaxing, creative escape for players who love to design, decorate, and bring beauty to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/43beb3d1dd5042b73904112a13f4d159.poster.avif?t=1791994869\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/43beb3d1dd5042b73904112a13f4d159.webm?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/extras/43beb3d1dd5042b73904112a13f4d159.mp4?t=1791994869\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Build, design, and decorate your dream ch\u00e2teau in a cozy vineyard valley. Live among your creations, harvest grapes from sunlit vineyards, and craft artisanal wine blends in a relaxing sandbox builder where every home helps restore beauty and balance to the countryside.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4059000/121fde8712579a6f7b5095f5fad0d88f360bec75/header.jpg?t=1791994869", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Multiplayer", "Cozy", "Relaxing", "Exploration", "Simulation", "Cute"], "developers": "Pangea Game Studios", "publishers": "Pangea Game Studios", "release_date": "Oct 14, 2026", "price": "$3.19", "appid": "4059000", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "14 October 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/BmoO8rJtTnk", "first_seen": 1791928800.0, "review_rank": 11}